<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, You died for our sins.</l><l>By Your blood we’re cleansed from within.</l><l>All of our failures have now been washed away.</l><l>O Lord, You’re living within</l><l>As the power of resurrection.</l><l>Conquer our death and our sin. Bring us to life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Lord, You’re speaking today.</l><l>Give us ears to hear what You say.</l><l>O Lord, from everything else we turn away.</l><l>O Lord, our eyes are on You.</l><l>Fill our hearts and minds with the truth.</l><l>O Lord, our whole life to You we consecrate.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
